"`USNE <https://www.bis.gov/press-release/department-commerce-announces-"
"rescission-biden-era-artificial-intelligence-diffusion-rule-strengthens>`_ "
"`GAO26 <https://www.gao.gov/products/b-337935>`_\\ ।"

